stemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：黄柠檬、洋甘菊、白色花香\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Lemon, Chamomile, White floral\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;\">\n          第三支来自于亚马逊大区的瑰夏，这一只是来自于一个合作社的批次，它的风味调性与另外一只小熊的瑰夏水洗很相似，花香的感受在中低温时会更接近，高温时这一只更柠檬更茶感一些;它是一个合作社的大批次, 价格更亲民一些；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;height: 411.214815px !important;background-size: 16px auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;height: 419.363889px !important;background-size: 16px auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S0n5Q6QGTxOt7fcwvWhXybN8TpxQTsWIqk4txDp2XgxFEq4cQia7QoMrwoYNLTxCx8bYzLlaCFjxA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;height: 902.666667px !important;background-size: 16px auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;\">\n          亚马逊区域在秘鲁北边，是上图红色部分，图片来源CAFE IMPORTS网站\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n           关于艾格瑞特合作社\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          艾格瑞特咖啡合作社（Agret Coffee Cooperative）成立于2000年5月22日，由亚马逊地区39个咖啡生产者协会联合组成。该合作社的使命是提升咖啡品质并创造附加值，从而打入国际精品咖啡市场。为实现这一目标，合作社采取有机认证、优化咖啡种植技术及公平贸易等策略，同时通过战略联盟扩大市场影响力。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibPSv6gBg48g89OHuicShQG0Po581pHVBvAEicXmqpgqbAnMHxALamA8nw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          此外，合作社还提供培训与技术援助，改进采收后处理流程（包括分拣、干燥与仓储），以进一步提升产品质量。截至2020年，合作社拥有320名成员，管理的咖啡种植园总面积达2,065.25公顷，其中1,404.50公顷为有机种植区。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibichJZ61CyjmvM9jC8Z2ekdhu6xWLDtPhJwNBVq3bmjJrPF1fHT1lMkg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          合作社坚持平等对待所有成员，尤其是青年、女性和原住民群体，确保其获得公平待遇与劳动权益。通过协同合作与资源高效利用，提高成员生活水平，并为亚马逊地区的可持续发展作出贡献。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);height: 187.85px !important;background-size: 16px auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;